dvantage (45.64 vs 32.885 MHz).\\n- 2026-11-22 hyp-20261122-001-r3s0 (regression, +8.66%): Registering the forwarded `rs1 + imm` sum at EX/MEM kept the multiplier DSP and EX result mux off the `dmem_addr` path, raising median Gowin Fmax from 45.640 to 49.590 MHz with the same timed CoreMark cycle count.\\n- \n13:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_5\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -c \\\"python - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\nx=json.loads(o\n…[97291 of 100363 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a6db4de904ef09c7]…\nrom tools.eval.gowin import build_all\\np,label,rtl=Path(sys.argv[1]),*sys.argv[2:]\\nx=build_all('.',p/rtl,'fpga/core_bench_si.sv',p/('timing-'+label))\\n(p/(label+'-timing.json')).write_text(json.dumps(x))\\nfor i in x: print(i['place_option'],i.get('fmax_mhz'),i.get('critical_paths',[])[:1])\\nPY\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"0 78.375 [{'from': 'cpu/u_mem/reg_q.alu_result_2_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu/dividend_q_28_s0', 'slack_ns': -7.759, 'arrival_ns': 18.053, 'logic_cells': 11, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu']}]\\n1 78.336 [{'from': 'cpu/u_mem/saved_raw_28_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_if/predicted_pc_q_23_s0', 'slack_ns': -7.765, 'arrival_ns': 18.06, 'logic_cells': 15, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_mem', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_id', 'cpu/u_if']}]\\n2 78.336 [{'from': 'cpu/u_mem/saved_raw_28_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_if/predicted_pc_q_23_s0', 'slack_ns': -7.765, 'arrival_ns': 18.06, 'logic_cells': 15, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_mem', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_id', 'cpu/u_if']}]\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
