kely source of the 156-cell path.\\nDisassembly of the 2K RV32IM -O3 CoreMark ELF shows five DIVU sites, all in\\nmain outside the measured call to iterate, and no other DIV or REM sites.\\nDivider latency therefore adds no direct stalls inside the timing markers.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Fold the four RV32M divide/remainder operations onto one unsigned restoring\\ndivider in EX. Capture the \n…[14087 of 17159 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d189e70779243978]…\nresults.\\n\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Check a load feeding DIV, consecutive dependent DIV/REM instructions and a store of the final result under instruction and data bus stalls. Check forwarded RVFI operands, consecutive retirement order and exactly one accepted store.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 70.94, \"delta_pct\": 485.31, \"vs_baseline\": 485.31, \"fmax_mhz\": 31.863, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2895, \"ff\": 563, \"seeds\": [31.114, 31.863, 31.863], \"perturbations\": [[0, 31.114, 48], [1, 31.863, 47], [2, 31.863, 47]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/remainder_q_1_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/remainder_q_1_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -27.139, \"arrival_ns\": 37.434, \"logic_cells\": 256, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 48, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-22T21:58:12.474969Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 1}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
