0261122-002-r3s1 (regression, +11.24%): A one-entry fall-through buffer let decode issue a word saved during a load-use or data-memory stall even with `imem_ready` low, cutting timed CoreMark cycles by 3.1% versus 6.4% for direct-branch prediction at a similar Fmax.\n- 2026-11-22 hyp-20261122-003-r3s2 (improvement, +17.19%): Computing B-type and JAL targets from the current instruction in IF/ID keeps targets exact even when the 128 two-bit direction counters alias, so correctly predicted taken transfers save a fetch slot and EX detects mispredictions with a one-bit XOR.\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"id\",\"title\",\"category\",\"motivation\",\"hypothesis\",\"expected_impact\",\"changes\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\":       {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^hyp-[0-9]{8}-[0-9]{3}(-r[0-9]+s[0-9]+)?$\"},\n    \"title\":    {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5},\n    \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"micro_opt\",\"structural\",\"extension\",\"predictor\",\"memory\"]},\n    \"motivation\":  {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20},\n    \"hypothesis\":  {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20},\n    \"expected_impact\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"fitness_delta_pct\",\"confidence\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"fitness_delta_pct\": {\"type\": \"integer\"},\n        \"confidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\"]}\n      }\n    },\n    \"changes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"file\",\"description\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"file\":        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Must be under rtl/ (any extension) or be a test/test_*.py cocotb suite. Anything else is rejected by the runtime sandbox check.\",\n            \"pattern\": \"^(rtl/[^.].*|test/test_[^/]