cles. Extending\\nthe bypass to signed LB saved only another 1,536 cycles in simulation\\nand put a four-lane sign selection on the path to the high operand bits.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"On the champion, a dependent instruction waits for WB even when MEM\\nalready has the load data. Ten CoreMar\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
