{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"The first prototype saved 218 CoreMark cycles, but its 81.480 MHz median fell short of the champion. A repeat of the champion’s median placement showed several long paths from WB data into the load-predictor read registers. I’m testing whether predicting address carries can shorten those paths while preserving most hits."}}
