st a cycle when\\nimemReady is low. A recurring sequence of instructions provides an\\nopportunity to p\n16:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261123-003-r5s2\", \"title\": \"Predict the successor instruction and precompute its direct target\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"The champion needs 4,238,604 cycles for ten timed CoreMark iterations.\\nAn earlier predece\n…[3693 of 6765 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:18af0291f91a9d0c]…\nith the raw bytes before releasing the consumer. The two\\nrepresentations cost 17 extra bits per row and put byte compari\n39:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261123-002-r13s1\", \"title\": \"Replace the radix-16 divider bank with a reciprocal ROM and seven tapered trials\", \"category\": \"structural\", \"motivation\": \"The champion spends 3,140,795 cycles on ten timed iterations. Its median\\nGowin placement is limited by the final divider trial feeding EX/MEM, even\\nthough the timed trace executes zero divides. Round 12 narrowed the trial\\nsubtractors to 290 data bits and reached 85.484 MHz. Mo\n40:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261123-003-r13s2\", \"title\": \"Prepare each branch's next direction when its outcome resolves\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"The champion missed 54,467 of 529,588 advancing conditional branches\\nduring the ten-iteration bracket. Replaying the same outcomes in\\nprogram order with eight bits of local history and 1,024 shared two-bit\\ncounters produced 29,934 misses in a trace model with immediate training.\\nRound 10 found \n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
